64) RAMB36 SECDED + 0x3C seed apoptosis radiation protection ahead of sub-billion wearable micro-LLMs (Sensente/uLM-28M, SmolLM2-135M, LiquidAI/LFM2.5-230M, Qwen3-0.6B, Mapika/decider-0.8b), Mamba-3, and native-ternary, looped, hybrid, and sparse-MoE models up to 120B parameters (prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B, thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini, Nemotron-Labs-Dory1.0-4B, LiquidAI/LFM2.5-24B-A2B, LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B, google/gemma-4-E2B-it, LiquidAI/LFM2.5-8B-A1B, Devstral-Small-2-24B-Instruct, Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B, and nvidia/Nemotron-3-Super-120B-A12B), gates commits and LastExam / ARC-AGI-2 / ARC-AGI-3 / MiniF2F-Lean4 / CritPt / VerilogEval / KernelBench / PutnamBench frontier answers behind deterministic, interactive world-model, and formal verifiers, compiles certified wakes downward into clock-enable-gated 81-RAMB36E2 / 83-RAMB36E1 Beneš-routed lookup (including a license-free openXC7 320.62 MHz post-PAR .bit bitstream and 365-crystal 1.46 MB on-die Artix-7 XC7A200T M.2 2280 port), Lupanov (-72.50%), DiffLUT-Net (-64.06%), TreeLUT, KAN-LUT, multilayer Benes-ARC-LUT6 (20.83% on ARC-AGI-2 n=24 and 12.50% = 2.00× over 1-layer on n=64), Interactive-MoL ARC-AGI-3 trajectory crystals, 2-bit wobble-codon, and two-tier LUT6 + T-MAC crystal pages, and serves them over both Python and zero-Python single-binary Rust OpenAI /v1/chat/completions and Model Context Protocol (MCP) JSON-RPC 2.0 servers (mol-agent / mol-agent-rs).
